275
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,700
Oh, God, no.

276
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,909
No, no, no.

277
00:12:53,929 --> 00:12:55,286
No. Nope.

278
00:12:55,306 --> 00:12:56,060
No...

279
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:56,480
No...

280
00:12:56,590 --> 00:12:57,280
No...

281
00:12:57,300 --> 00:12:57,930
No...

282
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,590
No...

283
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,100
Well, I'm sorry I brought it up.

284
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:07,240
