311
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:28,100
Good.

312
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:29,340
If you hold a spider.

313
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,580
Where?! Where?!

314
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:34,400
If you hold a spider.

315
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:35,260
I know.

316
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,920
Guys, is everything okay?

317
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,020
It's me, Joey.

318
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:49,880
Adoption!

319
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:53,440
What's going on?

320
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:55,400
Oh, it's just like I said, that crazy...

321
00:14:56,777 --> 00:14:59,577
