329
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:18,020
Oh, yeah. He has a caretaker.

330
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:18,840
His older brother...

331
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:20,900
...Ernie.

332
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,380
Bert and Ernie?

333
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,600
Bert and Ernie:《芝麻街》里的动画角色

334
00:15:25,620 --> 00:15:27,160
You can't make this stuff up.

335
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:31,280
You never told me about that guy

336
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:32,600
and your sweet 16.

337
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,560
I'm sorry about that.

338
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:35,800
Oh, it ended okay.

339
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:37,420
One of my friends shot him.

340
00:15:40,340 --> 00:15:42,160
At least you'll get a proper wedding.

341
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:43,420
You really deserve that.

342
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:44,580
Yeah, I really do.

343
00:15:44,890 --> 00:15:46,680
You know, I had nothing growing up.

344
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,700
Just like the kids I took the money from.

345
00:15:53,900 --> 00:15:55,300
No... I see where this is going.

346
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:56,660
Don't make me go back there.

347
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:01,200
Look, I can't have a wedding with this money now.

348
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:02,060
It's tainted.

349
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,280
Fine, we'll give the money back.

350
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,640
If that guy at the charity

351
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:07,580
gives us a hard time...

352
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,600
...my friend hasn't shot anyone in a really long time.

353
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:14,640
I must say this seems like

354
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:16,560
a lovely environment to raise a child in.

355
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:19,080
You are welcome to look under

356
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,840
any of the furniture...

357
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:20,900
...because, believe me,

358
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,980
you won't find any porn or cigarettes under there.

359
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,700
Before we look around,

360
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:26,280
let me make sure

361
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,900
I have everything I need up to here.

362
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:36,280
Why don't I show you the baby's room.

363
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,260
What are you doing?

364
