365
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:45,420
I thought you were in trouble.

366
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,420
Well, we're not.

367
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,520
But you called me "Bert."

368
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:51,160
That's our code word for danger.

369
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:54,420
We don't have a code word.

370
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:55,620
We don't?

371
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:57,800
We really should.

372
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,580
From now on,

373
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,480
"Bert" will be our code word for danger.

374
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:04,680
So that was the baby's room.

375
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:08,640
What room should we see next?

376
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:10,540
Any room that isn't behind this couch.

377
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,860
Some people don't get him,

378
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:16,120
but I think he's really funny.

379
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:25,960
I did not care for that.

380
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:28,960
You have to leave.

381
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,740
You slept with our social worker

382
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:31,880
and never called her back.

383
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,000
She is still pissed,

384
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,080
so she can't see you.

385
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:34,940
Okay, okay.

386
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,740
- What? - I forgot my bat.

387
00:17:44,780 --> 00:17:45,880
Oh, my God.

388
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:47,960
And for the last time,

389
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:50,540
we do not want to be friends with you!

390
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,780
And we don't wanna buy your bat!

391
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,920
What are you doing here?

392
00:17:59,586 --> 00:18:01,436
Bert...

393
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,000
Are you friends with him?

394
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,120
I can explain.

395
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:11,100
Joey?

396
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:13,260
All right. Okay.

397
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:21,320
You have got some nerve coming back here.

398
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:24,580
I can't believe you never called me.

399
00:18:24,940 --> 00:18:25,780
Excuse me?

400
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,460
You probably don't even remember my name.

401
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,380
It's Joey, by the way.

402
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:31,580
And don't bother telling me yours,

403
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:33,820
because I totally remember it, lady.

404
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:39,240
I waited weeks for you to call me.

405
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:40,440
I gave you my number.

406
00:18:40,460 --> 00:18:41,320
You never called me.

407
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:43,460
Don't try to turn this around on me.

408
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:47,580
I am not some kind of social work...

409
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:49,100
...that you can just...

410
00:18:50,409 --> 00:18:51,509
...do.

411
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,740
I'm pretty sure I gave you my number.

412
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:58,800
Really? Think about it. Come on.

413
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:00,080
You're a beautiful woman.

414
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,060
Smart, funny.

415
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:04,160
We had a really good time.

416
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,600
If I had your number,

417
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,980
