I'm sorry.

421
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:18,300
Hey, too late for apologies. Okay?

422
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:20,160
You broke my heart.

423
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,300
You know how many women

424
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:22,480
I had to sleep with to get over you?

425
