482
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:57,640
Hello?

483
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:00,380
Have you seen Joey's bat?

484
00:22:07,199 --> 00:22:09,849
Okay. I got a spider.

485
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:12,060
There were two, I picked the bigger one.

486
00:22:13,820 --> 00:22:15,320
- Okay. - Okay.

487
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:21,520
This feels perfectly normal.

488
00:22:23,100 --> 00:22:24,300
Okay, get on the swing.

489
00:22:27,740 --> 00:22:28,180
Okay.

490
00:22:30,177 --> 00:22:32,577
Okay.

491
00:22:37,889 --> 00:22:38,869
Okay.

492
00:22:46,462 --> 00:22:47,352
See?

493
00:22:47,360 --> 00:22:49,860
All right. I can do this.

494
00:22:49,940 --> 00:22:51,540
There you go. Good for you.

495
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:54,480
You know what? I'm getting used to this little guy.

496
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:56,960
I don't even feel him in here anymore.

497
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:58,080
That's because he's on your neck.

